From: KY Support <support@ky.com>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: gadget: tcm: fix cmd struct type mismatch

The KY patch changed cmd from single struct to array, but f_tcm.c
still uses single struct access. Revert cmd to single struct to
match f_tcm.c usage.

Signed-off-by: KY Support <support@ky.com>
---
 drivers/usb/gadget/function/tcm.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/usb/gadget/function/tcm.h
+++ b/drivers/usb/gadget/function/tcm.h
@@ -142,7 +142,7 @@ struct f_uas {
 	unsigned int		delayed_set_alt_state;
 	bool			delayed_set_alt_cancel;
 
-	struct usbg_cdb		cmd[USBG_NUM_CMDS];
+	struct usbg_cdb		cmd;
 	struct usb_ep		*ep_in;
 	struct usb_ep		*ep_out;
 
